{
  "id": "1CH.29",
  "number": "29",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "Ateptab Betusiek 1 29",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kiiyan bik sometab Daudi agobo kagochinoik",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji laitoriat Daudi tuiyet tugul, Ta ko ming’in Solomon werinnyu, ne kilewen inegei Kamuktaindet, ak ko ta ko etyet, ak ko o boisiet: amu goyoto bo laitoriat ko ma bo chito, bo Jehovah Kamuktaindet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiachob anyun eng’ kimnatennyu tugul, tahabu agobo tugukab tahabu, che bo gotab Kamuktaindennyu, ak feda agobo tugukab feda, ak sugunonik agobo tugukab sugunonik, ak karik agobo tugukab karik, ak ketik agobo tugukab ketik; koik che kiguure soam, ak koik che kitetei, kindoi kotabon ng’ony, ak che bo saleiywek che terjin, ak koik alak tugul che bo kamanutiet ne o, ak koik ng’isiat che leelach. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kogeny, amu kiacham mising’ gotab Kamuktaindennyu, ko u ye atinye tugukyuk che bo tahabu ak feda, agochini gotab Kamuktaindennyu, che siirei tuguk tugul che kiachopchi got ne tilil; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "talentaisiek elfusiek somok che bo tahabu, che bo tahabu che bo Opir, ak talentaisiek elfusiek tisab che bo feda che tililen, che kiliige inatusiekab gorik: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "che bo tahabu agobo tugukab tahabu, ak che bo feda agobo tugukab feda, ak che bo boisiet age tugul che yaei musogik. Ng’o anyun ne chamei kotabanjigei Jehovah eng’ betuni?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiigoito anyun eng’ chamnyet bounikab gorikab kwanisiek, ak bounikab ortinwekab Israel, ak kiptainikab elfusiek, ak che bo bogolwogik, koboto bounik che kibou boisietab laitoriat; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kiigoito agobo otisietab gotab Kamuktaindet talentaisiek elfusiek mut che bo tahabu koboto darkoni elfusiek taman, ak talentaisiek che bo feda elfusiek taman, ak che bo sugunonik talentaisiek elfusiek taman ak sisiit, ak che bo karik talentaisiek elfusiek bogol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ichek che kitinyei koik che bo kamanutiet ne o, ko kiigoito kinde ole kigonore tugukab gotab Jehovah, koba eutab Jehiel Gersonindet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koboiboitu anyun bik, amu kiigoito eng’ chamnyet, amu kiigochi Jehovah eng’ muguleldo ne igesunotgei: ak kibaibait agine laitoriat Daudi eng’ boiboiyet ne o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Komwaei Daudi kongoi, ak komeei",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolos anyun Daudi Jehovah eng’ taitab tuiyet tugul; ak kile Daudi, Iberurot inye, koigeny ak koigeny, ee Jehovah, Kamuktaindetab Israel kwandanyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheguk, ee Jehovah, oindo, ak kamuktaet, ak torornatet, ak katerteret, ak etunatet; amu cheguk tuguk tugul che mi kipsengwet ak che mi ng’ony; neng’ung’ bounatet, ee Jehovah, ak i tororot, i metitab tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bunun magornatosiek ak teegisto, ak ibou tugul; ak mi eung’ung’ kimnatet ak kamuktaet; inye ne ieeti, ak inye ne igochini tugul kimnatet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ara anyun, Kamuktaindennyo, kimwaun kongoi, ak kilosu kaineng’ung’ ne bo torornatet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago a ng’o, ak nee bikyuk, kot kimuch kigoite eng’ chamnyet ko u ni? Amu bunun tuguk tugul, ak kagigonin tuguguk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ki toek eng’ taing’ung’, ak ki kiprutoinik, ko u ye ki u kwanisiekyok tugul: u betusiekyok eng’ ng’ony uruet, ama mi ne tebyei agoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Jehovah Kamuktaindennyo, bunu eung’ung’ tuguchuto tugul kogechop si keteegunenen got ne bo kaineng’ung’ ne tilil, cheguk tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angen kogeny, ee Kamuktaindennyu ale, itieme muguleldo, ak ibaibaitune lititindo. Ak kiagonin tuguchuto tugul eng’ chamnyet ak lititindab muguleldanyu: ak kaageer nguno eng’ boiboiyet biguk che mi yu kogonin eng’ chamnyet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Jehovah, Kamuktaindetab Abraham, ak ko bo Isak, ak ko bo Israel, kwanisiekyok, rib ng’olyondonito koigeny eng’ kabwatutik che ibwati mugulelwekab biguk, ak ichopchige mugulelwekwak: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak igochi werinnyu Solomon muguleldo ne igesunotgei, si korib ng’atutiguk, ak baornatosieguk, ak konetisiosieguk, ak koyai tuguchuto tugul, ak koteech gotab laitoriat, ne kiachopchi tuguchuto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Daudi tuiyet tugul, Olosu Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’wong’. Ak kiilos tuiyet komugul Jehovah Kamuktaindetab kwanisiekwak, ak kong’uruk, kogutung’ji Jehovah, ak laitoriat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kieny tiseiywek koeng’ji Jehovah, ak kogochi Jehovah kagochinoik che kibeelei eng’ betut ne bo aeng’, eik elfut, mengichik elfut, ak arekab kechir elfut, koboto kagochinoikwak che kieei, ak korosek ng’isiat che bo Israel tugul; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kiamis ak koeeiso eng’ taitab Jehovah eng’ betunoto eng’ kagasetab ge ne o. Ak kiyai Solomon weritab Daudi koek laitoriat kogeny, ak koiil inendet eng’ taitab Jehovah koek bounindet, ak koiil Sadok koek tisiindet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotebe anyun Solomon ng’echeretab laitornatet ne bo Jehovah koek laitoriat, kogeer Daudi kwandanyi, ak kobor; ak kigas it Israel tugul inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kigas it bounik tugul, ak bik che kimen, koboto werik tugul che bo laitoriat Daudi, laitoriat Solomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiieet Jehovah Solomon mising’ eng’ taitab Israel tugul, ak kogochi inendet etunatetab laitornatet ne kitom kigochi laitoriat age tugul eng’ Israel ne kiindoune inendet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilaitoran Daudi anyun weritab Jesii eng’ Israel tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak betusiek che kilaitorane Israel ko ki kenyisiek artam; kilaitoran eng’ Hebron kenyisiek tisab, kolaitoran eng’ Jerusalem kenyisiek sosom ak somok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiilil, ko kagoyam betusiekyik, ak magornatosiek, ak teegisto: ak kilaitoran Solomon werinnyi kogeer inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
